{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV今天（21日）舉行2027節目巡禮，MIRROR的3位成員邱士縉（Stanley）﹑江𤒹生（AK）和盧瀚霆（AL，教主）出席。</p><p>早前已註冊結婚的Stanley，被爆25號峇里舉行婚禮，他表示：「不作回應，希望婚禮低調進行。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:01:21.983791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:12:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:37:37.726105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:57:41.711634+00:00","content_hash":"f07ff05be0f6fbb64b42cdb4f1ff08b2213cdb56c20b435efe2e12fa976d879e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}